nd":11,"surface":"藩","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng:xu-sons:p001:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"組","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":100,"last_line":100,"revision_id":2108782,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng","book_id":"b-jinshu-039","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-039","source_id":"s-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng","source":{"title":"王沈荀顗荀勖馮紞列傳第九（數位選錄）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷039&oldid=2108782","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷039&oldid=2108782","revision_id":2108782,"accessed_on":"2026-10-18","extent":"荀氏家族相關局部選錄；不是全卷轉錄或完整人物覆核。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；保留固定數位見證及轉錄來源歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng:yi-intro:p001","source_lines":[51,51],"raw_quote":"　　荀顗，字景倩，潁川人，魏太尉彧之第六子也。幼為姊婿陳群所賞。性至孝，總角知名，博學洽聞，理思周密。魏時以父勳除中郎。宣帝輔政，見顗奇之，曰：「荀令君之子也。」擢拜散騎侍郎，累遷侍中。為魏少帝執經，拜騎都尉，賜爵關內侯。難鍾會《[[易]]》無互體，又與扶風王駿論仁孝孰先，見稱於世。","raw_quote_sha256":"fedbb794aa1c1174185546521a49178136a04bd36fed9a12009545cc3b6125d6","body_before_excerpt_selection":"　　荀顗，字景倩，潁川人，魏太尉彧之第六子也。幼為姊婿陳群所賞。性至孝，總角知名，博學洽聞，理思周密。魏時以父勳除中郎。宣帝輔政，見顗奇之，曰：「荀令君之子也。」擢拜散騎侍郎，累遷侍中。為魏少帝執經，拜騎都尉，賜爵關內侯。難鍾會《[[易]]》無互體，又與扶風王駿論仁孝孰先，見稱於世。","body_selection":{"start":2,"end":23,"begin_anchor":"荀顗，字景倩，潁川人","end_anchor":"魏太尉彧之第六子也。"}},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng:xu-intro:p001","source_lines":[66,66],"raw_quote":"　　荀勖，字公曾，潁川潁陰人，漢司空爽曾孫也。祖棐，射聲校尉。父肸，早亡。勖依于舅氏。岐嶷夙成，年十餘歲能屬文。從外祖魏太傅鍾繇曰：「此兒當及其曾祖。」既長，遂博學，達于從政。仕魏，辟大將軍曹爽掾，遷中書通事郎。爽誅，門生故吏無敢往者，勖獨臨赴，眾乃從之。為安陽令，轉驃騎從事中郎。勖有遺愛，安陽生為立祠。遷廷尉正，參文帝大將軍軍事，賜爵關內侯，轉從事中郎，領記室。","raw_quote_sha256":"d0f17b8ec321eb24cc8ff6c1d4d0d28a85ec48c3b5e48c394b9403d523f9ea1f","body_before_excerpt_selection":"　　荀勖，字公曾，潁川潁陰人，漢司空爽曾孫也。祖棐，射聲校尉。父肸，早亡。勖依于舅氏。岐嶷夙成，年十餘歲能屬文。從外祖魏太傅鍾繇曰：「此兒當及其曾祖。」既長，遂博學，達于從政。仕魏，辟大將軍曹爽掾，遷中書通事郎。爽誅，門生故吏無敢往者，勖獨臨赴，眾乃從之。為安陽令，轉驃騎從事中郎。勖有遺愛，安陽生為立祠。遷廷尉正，參文帝大將軍軍事，賜爵關內侯，轉從事中郎，領記室。","body_selection":{"start":2,"end":37,"begin_anchor":"荀勖，字公曾，潁川潁","end_anchor":"聲校尉。父肸，早亡。"}},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-039-wangxun-feng:xu-sons:p001","source_lines":[100,100],"raw_quote":"　　勖久管機密，有才思，探得人主微旨，不犯顏忤爭，故得始終全其寵祿。{{YL|太康十年}}卒，詔贈司徒，賜東園秘器、朝服一具、錢五十萬、布百匹。遣兼御史持節護喪，諡曰成。勖有十子，其達者輯、藩、組。","raw_quote_sha256":"60d32a3b8a8b0d7a80ee5a7fab36d8db6c0743c787e560b87545df107938d6dc","begin_anchor":"勖有十子，其達者輯、藩、組。","end_anchor":"勖有十子，其達者輯、藩、組。"}],"extraction_note":"按明列首尾選錄；保留原字，Kanripo正文與括號古注、頁標分離，維基文庫選句沒有模板轉換。未核書影，未完成全卷。"},"response_sha256":"6024484babc384e46d119f771afcfcc00dda04e96dfd57c6e2e220bfc11ca63f","wikitext_sha256":"93fdc36293b084a3693b073808ba92095e730973f8e4c5b2b4dd19fb1e9cea4c","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，底本影像未核"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAB","representative_source_person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAB","source_person_ids":["yoo_ox0_545_FAAAB"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAA","source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu039-xun-sons-001","connection":"father","interpretation_note":"依勖有十子原句列其達者，不以三人列舉順序充作出生排行。","assembly_id":"family-xun-shu-early-medieval","root_person_id":"yoo_ox0_545","status":"editorial_preferred","human_reviewed":false}}
